`slugify` in src/slugify.ts now normalizes to NFD, strips combining marks, lowercases, collapses non-letter/digit runs to a single dash, and trims leading/trailing dashes — so `Crème Brûlée` → `creme-brulee` and punctuation-only/empty input → `''`.

